   349 				/// Fractional part.
   350 				/**	@param .word math_arg0	Unsigned divident (16-bits).
   351 					@param .word math_arg1	Unsigned divisor (16-bits).
   352 					@return .word math_arg2	Unsigned result (16-bits).
